======================================

This file is generated from Cargo.lock with cargo-about. It covers the Rust
dependency graph for the x86_64-pc-windows-msvc target. The Python package
"numpy" declared in Requires-Dist is installed separately and is not bundled
inside the rustures wheel; the Rust crate named "numpy" is covered below.

Regenerate with:

    cargo about generate --locked --fail -c about.toml -o THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES about.hbs

